On [check box]
To activate the object Socket as such, select this check box.
Remarks
If you are using the object Socket as a server socket 
 , it then listens on the specified Port.
If you are using the object Socket as a client socket 
 , it attempts to connect to a server.
Instead, you can also right-click the object Socket in the Frame and select Activate on the context menu.
To deactivate it, select Deactivate on the context menu.
