On [SimTalk]
Activates the Socket Interface designated by <Path> as such (true) or deactivates it (false).
Remarks
If you are using it as a Server Socket 
 , it then listens on the specified Port.
If you are using it as a Client Socket 
 , it attempts to connect to a server.
